{
  "headline": "FDA's records show paclitaxel has been on the shortage list for 61 months as of 2026-10-21; current supply traces to Sagent (plant GLAND, sponsor-only link) and Alembic (plant FEI 3014866088, VAI 2024-03-08)",
  "headline_cites": ["D7", "E6", "E8", "E7"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 61 months since the 2021-10-05 posting.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds two NDCs: 25021025550 from Sagent Pharmaceuticals (label 5721b9bf) and 46708062117 from Alembic Pharmaceuticals Limited (label 6d04b514).",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds the same two NDCs: 25021025550 from Sagent and 46708062117 from Alembic.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Sagent product label names plant GLAND with a sponsor-only link and no FDA inspection classification is provided.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Alembic product label names plant Alembic Pharmaceuticals Limited (FEI 3014866088, India) with a registered plant link and a VAI inspection on 2024-03-08 known to FDA on 2024-05-02.",
      "cites": ["E8", "E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to transfer 4 units from Corvale General to Corvale Lakeside; Corvale General has 26 days on hand and can spare 4 while keeping two weeks, and Corvale Lakeside has 9.2 days and would reach 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D2", "D3", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Verify the Sagent plant GLAND inspection status and confirm Alembic FEI 3014866088 current classification before relying on these sources.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E8", "E7"]
    }
  ]
}
